### Core Architectural Features Implemented

1. **Strict Role Boundaries & Deterministic Calculation**:
   - Arithmetic, concentration weights, and risk limit rules reside exclusively in [risk_engine.py](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/src/tools/risk_engine.py) and [exposure.py](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/src/tools/exposure.py).
   - [test_architecture_lint.py](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/tests/unit/test_architecture_lint.py) enforces that [tools/](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/src/tools/) contains zero LLM imports.

2. **Evidence Before Recommendation**:
   - [source_freshness_validator](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/src/tools/retrieval.py) enforces a 45-day freshness ceiling.
   - [evidence_integrity_check](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/src/tools/evidence.py) validates that every idea cites fresh source IDs from the validated research brief.

3. **Status Gates in Suitability Critic**:
   - **`PASS`**: Meets all constraints; routes directly to [MemoFormatterAgent](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/src/agents/memo_formatter.py).
   - **`FLAG`**: Soft guideline breach (e.g., US Equity 50–65%, single stock 20–30%); pauses graph for RM exception override.
   - **`FAIL`**: Hard breach (single stock > 30%, liquidity coverage < 1.0x, unverified evidence); triggers selective regeneration in [InvestmentIdeaAgent](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/src/agents/investment_idea.py).

4. **Selective Regeneration**:
   - In [workflow.py](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/src/graph/workflow.py), `node_mark_failed_slots` locks ideas that passed, selectively passing only rejected slots into `regenerate_slots`.
   - Verified by `test_selective_regeneration_locks_passed_ideas`: when Slot #2 is rejected, Slots #1 and #3 remain locked and byte-for-byte identical.

5. **3-Panel Relationship Manager Workspace**:
   - Implemented in [streamlit_app.py](file:///c:/Users/User/Downloads/FA-pipeline-main/FA-pipeline-main/FMPT-main/streamlit_app.py) with real-time workflow stage progress (Left), decision space with before/after allocation diffs and breach boxes (Center), and live memo preview highlighting stage-affected sections with PDF export (Right).

